                <pb facs="0384" n="378" sameAs="frus:frus1901China/pg378"/>

                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Mr. Rockhill to Mr.
                            Hay.</hi></head>
                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Telegram.—Paraphrase.]</seg></opener>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Peking</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1901-08-04"><hi rendition="#italic">August 4,
                        1901</hi></date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p>(Mr. Rockhill reports that the international commission for the con-Version of
                    the present Chinese tariff into specific rate will begin very soon at Shanghai.
                    Asks if an expert (who should start immediately) will be detailed by the
                    Secretary of the Treasury to represent the United States in it.)</p>
            </div>
        </body>
